# Twist Reality's second mode, "Manifest dread" (CR 701.62a): of Llanowar Elves and Lightning Bolt the Elves goes face down as a
# 2/2 and the Bolt to the graveyard. Nothing is countered (the mode has no target, so it can be chosen with no spell on the stack).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Twist Reality
Island x3
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Twist Reality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Manifest dread)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Twist Reality; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield..Toughness = 2
